# Signing material. *.jks and *.keystore were already ignored above; this adds
# the properties file some setups use for the passwords.
#
# THE INTENTION IS HERE; THE ENFORCEMENT IS IN ReleaseSecretsGuardTest, because
# a .gitignore only protects files nobody has already added — `git add -f`, and
# a file staged before the pattern existed, both walk straight past it.
keystore.properties
